ense source embedding, and state factorization is extended from words only through closed linear submodules. The positivity conversion explicitly uses the pinned spectral C-star order; it does not replace positivity by an axiom. Compilation and axiom reports validate the Lean artifact, not the inherited coordinate hypotheses or later operator-algebraic claims.\n\n## Cleanup and worktree state\n\nKept intentionally: the integrated P59A candidate, its exact archive, quarantine extraction, and this review. All pre-existing modified and untracked plan, packet, candidate, and review files were preserved. No manuscript file was changed; no commit, push, archive build, dependency update, or dependency fetch occurred.\n\nCLOSEOUT_ARTIFACTS_PRESENT\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
